# R-73: no macro_rules! in the library outside the lead's list (no-macro-definition, an
# error); every macro_rules! is still listed for review (macro-definition-review).

case: macro-definition
tool: ast-grep
expect: macro-definition-review
--- module
macro_rules! planted {
    () => {
        1
    };
}

case: macro-definition-outside-list
tool: ast-grep
expect: no-macro-definition
--- module
macro_rules! planted {
    () => {
        1
    };
}
